WEBVTT

00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:23.470
The 7th Division is attacking!

00:00:23.470 --> 00:00:25.050
We're going to be killed!

00:00:25.050 --> 00:00:26.900
Open the doors!

00:00:28.090 --> 00:00:30.660
Sugimoto, what the hell do we do?

00:00:30.660 --> 00:00:32.190
We run!

00:00:32.190 --> 00:00:35.150
You're the Escape King, 
so think of a way to get us out!

00:00:43.210 --> 00:00:46.650
I'm afraid you still need to stay here.

00:00:59.600 --> 00:01:02.060
<b>Golden Kamuy</b>

00:02:21.660 --> 00:02:26.520
<b>Episode Twenty-Three
Overwhelmed</b>

00:02:21.880 --> 00:02:27.220
So you were with Lt. Tsurumi 
this whole time, Inkarmat?

00:02:28.130 --> 00:02:31.070
Sugimoto-san's group has failed.

00:02:31.070 --> 00:02:38.630
Now that this has happened, only Lt. Tsurumi 
can get Nopperabo and Asirpa-chan out.

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:42.880
But then the 7th will get the Ainu gold!

00:02:42.880 --> 00:02:44.690
Are you okay with that?

00:02:44.690 --> 00:02:51.980
It doesn't matter to me, or to you,
 who gets the gold, does it?

00:02:54.490 --> 00:02:56.980
<i>Women are terrifying.</i>

00:02:57.590 --> 00:02:59.850
Follow your training,
and get to your positions!

00:02:59.850 --> 00:03:03.410
Put the Maxim guns on both sides of the gate!

00:03:04.410 --> 00:03:08.330
Concentrate your fire on them 
when they break through the gate!

00:03:09.410 --> 00:03:11.680
We'll rip them all apart.

00:03:11.680 --> 00:03:14.460
And then we won't need to buy 
pig food for a long while.

00:03:18.340 --> 00:03:20.450
We'll escape into the tunnel! Hurry!

00:03:39.300 --> 00:03:41.170
Fire!

00:04:04.490 --> 00:04:06.240
Don't you want to see your father?

00:04:16.500 --> 00:04:17.640
This is bad.

00:04:17.640 --> 00:04:18.900
Time to get the hell out!

00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:24.710
That's the wall facing the Abashiri River.

00:04:24.710 --> 00:04:26.200
They outsmarted us!

00:04:35.670 --> 00:04:40.590
Lt. Tsurumi, what do you intend 
to tell Central Command?

00:04:41.610 --> 00:04:43.090
Locusts.

00:04:43.570 --> 00:04:44.760
Locusts?

00:04:45.540 --> 00:04:47.200
It's happened before.

00:04:47.200 --> 00:04:52.500
In 1882, the Japanese army used ship cannons
 in an attempt to disperse locusts.

00:04:52.500 --> 00:04:54.520
Here's the scenario.

00:04:54.520 --> 00:04:59.330
In order to disperse a swarm of locusts 
moving up the eastern coastline of Hokkaido,

00:04:59.330 --> 00:05:05.750
we requested aid from Rear Admiral Koito, 
Commander of the Ominato Guard District.

00:05:05.750 --> 00:05:06.880
Yup.

00:05:06.880 --> 00:05:11.320
During our return to Shari, a riot 
broke out at Abashiri Prison.

00:05:11.320 --> 00:05:14.770
We arrived to help end it.

00:05:16.200 --> 00:05:19.890
Nobody from the mainland is 
going to come all the way out

00:05:19.890 --> 00:05:23.760
to the ends of the earth to 
investigate either story for themselves.

00:05:24.220 --> 00:05:28.070
They never do. They just 
read what we send them.

00:05:28.840 --> 00:05:34.350
If even a single person from the 
prison survives, that's not going to work.

00:05:36.840 --> 00:05:39.980
Survivors? From the prison?

00:05:48.850 --> 00:05:51.510
That's the goddamn army! We can't beat them!

00:05:51.510 --> 00:05:52.710
I'm surrendering!

00:05:52.710 --> 00:05:54.840
But I heard you'll be killed.

00:05:54.840 --> 00:06:00.170
That's a lie! It's a lie Warden Inudou
 spread to get us to fight!

00:06:03.450 --> 00:06:04.760
There they are!

00:06:08.760 --> 00:06:11.280
Don't shoot! I surrender!

00:06:16.290 --> 00:06:18.500
Hurry! To the cells!

00:06:26.740 --> 00:06:28.950
They've come to kill us all!

00:06:29.320 --> 00:06:33.700
If you don't fight,
the reaper will overwhelm you!

00:06:37.700 --> 00:06:38.840
Inkarmat!

00:06:39.580 --> 00:06:42.340
Inkarmat! Where are you?

00:06:42.340 --> 00:06:43.960
Tanigaki Nispa!

00:06:45.080 --> 00:06:46.210
Inkarmat!

00:06:49.320 --> 00:06:50.310
Inkarmat!

00:06:52.900 --> 00:06:54.120
Run...

00:06:55.780 --> 00:06:57.930
I can't let you die here!

00:07:17.750 --> 00:07:18.790
Move!

00:07:36.610 --> 00:07:37.390
Ushiyama!

00:07:38.760 --> 00:07:40.390
Go. Now.

00:07:41.460 --> 00:07:44.060
Ushiyama-san, get out of there!

00:07:45.170 --> 00:07:48.900
You two... had better damn 
well be happy together.

00:07:50.600 --> 00:07:52.450
No! Ushiyama-san!

00:07:56.770 --> 00:07:58.450
Umph!

00:08:01.930 --> 00:08:03.970
My jacket got dirty.

00:08:18.260 --> 00:08:21.100
Those are the star shells that were 
used in the Russo-Japanese War.

00:08:38.770 --> 00:08:41.210
Sergeant Tsukishima, do it.

00:08:46.950 --> 00:08:48.670
They threw something!

00:08:53.770 --> 00:08:55.590
Charge forward, and kill them all!

00:09:04.600 --> 00:09:06.660
Shiraishi, what are you doing?

00:09:06.660 --> 00:09:11.800
There's a narrow space under each 
cell that allows air in and out.

00:09:13.410 --> 00:09:15.070
Shut up, damn it!

00:09:15.070 --> 00:09:17.280
Keep your damned mouth shut!

00:09:23.130 --> 00:09:25.850
Did you know he was a fake?

00:09:27.650 --> 00:09:29.970
Did Kadokura know, too?

00:09:29.970 --> 00:09:36.800
After we escaped, Warden Inudou secretly 
switched out Nopperabo for a decoy.

00:09:37.160 --> 00:09:41.080
Kadokura spent seven years 
seeing Nopperabo every day.

00:09:41.080 --> 00:09:44.180
He's not stupid enough to have not noticed.

00:09:44.180 --> 00:09:47.220
Did he know that when he sent them in there?

00:09:49.560 --> 00:09:52.340
Just come with us, Asirpa.

00:09:52.950 --> 00:09:54.680
You'll miss your chance.

00:10:02.760 --> 00:10:03.350
There they are!

00:10:03.770 --> 00:10:05.160
What are you doing? Run!

00:10:11.910 --> 00:10:13.590
Where's Nopperabo?

00:10:20.930 --> 00:10:22.930
<i>Usami?!</i>

00:10:33.270 --> 00:10:36.030
Immortal Sugimoto...

00:10:36.730 --> 00:10:38.530
I need to save Sugimoto.

00:10:39.050 --> 00:10:41.790
If he's not with me, I'm not going.

00:10:41.790 --> 00:10:47.790
If he sees his daughter,
 Nopperabo will tell us where the gold is.

00:10:48.680 --> 00:10:51.900
That was our hope. 
That's why we all came here.

00:10:51.900 --> 00:10:57.690
Sugimoto would want that more 
than he would care about himself.

00:10:58.360 --> 00:10:59.460
Get back!

00:10:59.460 --> 00:11:03.050
Just so we're clear, I haven't gotten 
the location of the gold from him yet!

00:11:09.510 --> 00:11:11.270
Where is my aca?

00:11:12.440 --> 00:11:16.390
I've got sixty-three of my men with me.

00:11:16.390 --> 00:11:19.960
Do you think you can get 
away from us like that?

00:11:20.250 --> 00:11:22.220
Let's find out!

00:11:22.220 --> 00:11:24.360
All of you, throw down your weapons and—

00:11:25.140 --> 00:11:27.700
Nikaidou!

00:11:28.520 --> 00:11:31.050
Let me go! I'll kill him!

00:11:31.050 --> 00:11:32.210
That was the deal!

00:11:33.490 --> 00:11:37.190
Idiot! What if it hits Nopperabo?

00:11:41.690 --> 00:11:44.330
All of you, out of the building!

00:11:44.330 --> 00:11:47.740
I'll blow his head off! You got that?

00:11:51.210 --> 00:11:54.070
Chief Kadokura!

00:11:54.750 --> 00:11:56.580
It's good to see you again!

00:11:58.190 --> 00:12:00.580
What's with that mole?

00:12:03.970 --> 00:12:07.950
Sorry, Chief Kadokura. I aimed for your neck.

00:12:10.200 --> 00:12:16.210
New kid... I didn't explain 
how this worked yet, did I?

00:12:21.620 --> 00:12:26.570
It's a device that unlocks every single cell,
first used in Kabato Prison.

00:12:33.000 --> 00:12:37.440
Are you ready to fight 700 deadly criminals?

00:13:00.370 --> 00:13:01.710
Affix bayonets!

00:13:05.240 --> 00:13:07.910
Exterminate every last one of them!

00:13:09.220 --> 00:13:11.970
<b>Golden Kamuy</b>

00:13:26.520 --> 00:13:28.280
Sugimoto!

00:13:33.690 --> 00:13:35.210
Sugimoto?

00:13:38.810 --> 00:13:41.480
That old bastard Hijikata must've 
set this whole thing up.

00:13:41.480 --> 00:13:43.730
If Toni Anji was working with him,

00:13:43.730 --> 00:13:47.090
then Asirpa-chan might be 
with Hijikata right now.

00:13:47.440 --> 00:13:53.160
If he sent us into the cell block with the
 fake Nopperabo and stirred up a ruckus,

00:13:53.160 --> 00:13:58.630
he knew Inudou would panic and head for 
the place where the real Nopperabo was kept.

00:13:58.630 --> 00:14:02.180
That was the plan all along.

00:14:03.360 --> 00:14:06.670
<i>While Kadokura kept us here,</i>

00:14:06.930 --> 00:14:09.490
<i>he would bring Asirpa-san 
to meet her father,</i>

00:14:09.490 --> 00:14:12.450
<i>learn the location of the gold, and escape.</i>

00:14:12.450 --> 00:14:16.730
<i>He plans to use this chance to 
separate me from Asirpa-san,</i>

00:14:17.410 --> 00:14:19.770
<i>because he knows I'll 
get in his way eventually.</i>

00:14:29.080 --> 00:14:32.410
Okay! All you have to do to get 
out is dislocate both shoulders.

00:14:32.410 --> 00:14:33.970
I can't do that!

00:14:33.970 --> 00:14:37.020
Damn it! Is there no way out?

00:14:37.020 --> 00:14:39.610
I'll find something I can 
use to break the wall.

00:14:39.610 --> 00:14:43.270
I'll find my own way out. 
Go look for Asirpa-san.

00:14:43.270 --> 00:14:46.520
When you get her, wait at the main gate.

00:14:47.610 --> 00:14:50.530
Take care of her, Shiraishi!

00:14:53.220 --> 00:14:55.040
<b>Chapel</b>

00:14:55.040 --> 00:14:58.540
<b>Chapel</b>

00:15:04.550 --> 00:15:05.560
There he is.

00:15:05.560 --> 00:15:07.800
I knew it. The chapel.

00:15:08.500 --> 00:15:14.240
Inudou goes there every day to practice, 
so I was already suspicious of it.

00:15:14.640 --> 00:15:17.440
But no matter how many times 
Kadokura searched the place,

00:15:17.440 --> 00:15:20.020
he couldn't find any hidden rooms.

00:15:20.020 --> 00:15:22.020
So Aca is here, right?

00:15:22.020 --> 00:15:26.270
We catch Inudou when he 
tries to move Nopperabo.

00:15:31.660 --> 00:15:33.360
Are you okay?

00:15:33.360 --> 00:15:36.650
Let's get into the building. 
My eardrums hurt.

00:15:37.480 --> 00:15:39.240
Asirpa's gone!

00:15:39.240 --> 00:15:40.040
Huh?

00:15:40.930 --> 00:15:44.080
She headed back to Sugimoto, huh?

00:15:44.080 --> 00:15:48.560
She vanished the second she 
heard where Nopperabo was.

00:15:48.560 --> 00:15:51.290
Tough little girl, that one.

00:15:51.290 --> 00:15:52.580
Do we bring her back?

00:15:52.580 --> 00:15:56.020
No, for now we need to get Inudou.

00:15:56.600 --> 00:16:00.250
I guess I'll have to use 
these to make him believe.

00:16:06.610 --> 00:16:07.820
Quiet!

00:16:07.820 --> 00:16:09.090
Hurry! Hurry!

00:16:12.050 --> 00:16:13.130
Shiraishi!

00:16:13.650 --> 00:16:14.860
Asirpa-chan!

00:16:14.860 --> 00:16:15.890
Where's Sugimoto?

00:16:15.890 --> 00:16:18.340
Trapped beneath the floors of the cells.

00:16:18.340 --> 00:16:21.390
The air duct was so small 
that only I could get out.

00:16:21.390 --> 00:16:23.320
Wait, wait. Don't go.

00:16:23.320 --> 00:16:24.870
There are too many solders.

00:16:24.870 --> 00:16:25.960
But...

00:16:25.960 --> 00:16:28.880
Fine. I'll save Sugimoto.

00:16:29.810 --> 00:16:32.670
Take him to the chapel.

00:16:32.670 --> 00:16:35.510
Hijikata Toshizou says 
that's where Nopperabo is.

00:16:35.510 --> 00:16:37.830
We can't do that, either.

00:16:37.830 --> 00:16:41.540
Sugimoto told us to wait at the main gate.

00:16:41.540 --> 00:16:44.730
No. I need to meet Aca and 
see if it's really him.

00:16:44.730 --> 00:16:47.690
You can't go back to Hijikata!

00:16:47.690 --> 00:16:51.740
He's trying to separate you from Sugimoto!

00:16:53.030 --> 00:16:54.240
From Sugimoto?

00:16:54.240 --> 00:16:57.160
Once I save Sugimoto, I'll go to the chapel.

00:16:57.610 --> 00:17:00.120
I'll try to find some way 
to get Nopperabo to the main gate.

00:17:00.120 --> 00:17:01.240
Wait.

00:17:02.090 --> 00:17:03.750
Give this to Sugimoto.

00:17:18.790 --> 00:17:21.320
How the hell do you dislocate your shoulders?

00:17:21.320 --> 00:17:22.270
Sugimoto!

00:17:22.270 --> 00:17:23.430
Kiroranke!

00:17:24.290 --> 00:17:25.750
Are you stupid?

00:17:25.750 --> 00:17:27.700
There's no way out of that.

00:17:27.700 --> 00:17:28.770
What will you do?

00:17:29.260 --> 00:17:32.280
Jam grenades between the wall and the dirt.

00:17:36.210 --> 00:17:37.690
Find a safe place.

00:17:38.490 --> 00:17:39.280
Hey, wait—

00:17:43.010 --> 00:17:44.040
Did he fart?

00:17:49.750 --> 00:17:50.970
The chapel?

00:17:50.970 --> 00:17:53.550
Asirpa said to show this to Nopperabo.

00:17:55.210 --> 00:17:58.050
It's Asirpa-san's makiri.

00:17:58.570 --> 00:18:00.600
The one her father made.

00:18:01.650 --> 00:18:03.360
Wait at the main gate.

00:18:03.360 --> 00:18:05.060
I'm worried about leaving 
her alone with Shiraishi.

00:18:05.850 --> 00:18:07.690
I'll take Nopperabo there.

00:18:08.230 --> 00:18:11.310
Tell Asirpa-san I promise 
she'll see him soon.

00:18:11.310 --> 00:18:12.470
Okay.

00:18:38.880 --> 00:18:40.890
<b>Chapel</b>

00:18:45.940 --> 00:18:47.890
I hear something from below.

00:18:48.550 --> 00:18:51.150
So there was a basement?

00:19:01.450 --> 00:19:02.410
Get out.

00:19:03.780 --> 00:19:07.170
I'll put out both of Inudou's eyes.

00:19:49.190 --> 00:19:51.660
Till death do us part.

00:20:12.560 --> 00:20:13.440
<i>What?</i>

00:20:20.400 --> 00:20:24.160
Yohei, Sugimoto's going that way!

00:20:33.370 --> 00:20:36.130
Hey, look! Somebody's lying on the ground!

00:20:36.130 --> 00:20:37.700
It's Nikaidou!

00:20:38.170 --> 00:20:39.630
Is he alive?

00:20:43.630 --> 00:20:45.590
Nopperabo...

00:20:46.090 --> 00:20:48.180
I'll bring you to Asirpa-san.

00:20:48.810 --> 00:20:50.140
To Asirpa-san...

00:20:52.330 --> 00:20:54.140
Stop! Somebody's coming!

00:20:55.110 --> 00:20:56.650
It's Ushiyama and the others!

00:21:01.930 --> 00:21:03.170
Kiro-chan!

00:21:03.650 --> 00:21:04.650
Where's Sugimoto?

00:21:04.650 --> 00:21:06.950
I rescued him from the prison.

00:21:06.950 --> 00:21:09.250
But he went to the chapel alone.

00:21:09.250 --> 00:21:12.160
He promised he'd arrange 
for you to see Nopperabo.

00:21:14.090 --> 00:21:16.790
Hijikata and Inudou are there, too.

00:21:17.280 --> 00:21:18.550
Let's go.

00:21:19.610 --> 00:21:21.300
You stay here.

00:21:21.690 --> 00:21:23.050
But...

00:21:23.730 --> 00:21:25.050
Inkarmat.

00:21:25.940 --> 00:21:28.770
Maybe I can get a better view from up high.

00:22:01.430 --> 00:22:02.570
Blue eyes!

00:23:35.350 --> 00:23:40.250
<b>Next Time
Call Out</b>

00:23:35.620 --> 00:23:39.160
Next Time: "Call Out."
